{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act3d0_level_act3d0_ex06_end",
  "groupId": "act3d0",
  "stageId": "a003_ex06",
  "title": "完美落幕",
  "storyCode": "OF-EX6",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_ex06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "d3ab1b5667b580fa7a17b440cf8b68d4ddd156f4b9d65f9d5a6d22fc9e98a12d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這就是傳聞中的羅德島啊，感覺確實是個充滿了謎團的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "空氣中還夾雜著一股非常熟悉的氣息。嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要不是真的登上這艘載具，我還以為自己依然待在海邊呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "這裡近期確實接待過幾個阿戈爾人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "你也是阿戈爾的訪客，但我沒在訪客名單上看到你的名字。我也許沒法接待你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊啊，抱歉抱歉，不過不勞煩你了，我說點事就走，不會在這裡待太久的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咦，你居然還知道我的名字？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "這幾天會待在汐斯塔一帶的人，沒有人不知道你的名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "雖然我並沒有去，但我也早有耳聞。日落即逝的貝斯手Alty女士，羅德島不是個可以隨意進出的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊呀，唉，不要那麼有敵意啊。畢竟我們有很多共同話題，對吧，比如說還能看到星星的時候？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "——請坐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "謝謝。你肯定會好奇我是怎麼進來的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這不重要的，你不用擔心羅德島的安保設施有什麼漏洞，單純是我運氣好罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "話語掩蓋不了你的實力。請放心，我不怎麼擔憂，至少它只會對重要的訪客網開一面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "不過，一位音樂巨星是怎麼對這狹小的病房產生興趣的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "如果是想和你的阿戈爾朋友敘舊，你可能走錯房間了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "朋友？嗯......談不上吧？不，該說，離朋友有點遠呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "其實我是來找你的。或者說，是來看看你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "很抱歉，我不認識你，我也不是動物園的展品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿戈爾人的傳聞，我從Frost那裡聽說了很多。她很少講故事的，但那次她說了很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "我沒興趣聽你說些你朋友的奇異冒險故事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那唱出來怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "......或是面目全非的有關我的逸聞。我希望你能更直接一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有人告訴過我閒聊可以緩和氣氛，我做的似乎不太成功......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就開始吧。我其實有些討厭他們阿戈爾人。當然我也知道，他們確實挺可憐的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是，如果沒有你出現的話，這幾個阿戈爾人可能都會沉入海底，被幽暗的海洋吞噬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "我並沒有做什麼重要的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你救了他們，而且這裡就有好幾個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這些特別的阿戈爾人，他們一點都不尊敬你，明明你為他們做了這麼多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你平時是不是對他們太凶了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "我只是在阻止他們自取滅亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那也是種慈悲心的體現，醫生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只不過，我的問題也就在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "請說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你知道阿戈爾人的敵人是什麼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "或者，你其實知道我的身份吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerToken": "npc_10002",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "Mon3tr，停下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "你很年輕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的，我們很年輕，我們沒有經歷過那些悲傷的事情，所以我們還在這，還可以說話，還可以唱歌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "深海獵人們在做他們應該做的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我明白，這些我都明白。只不過，我們也想知道答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們一點也不想和這些小傢伙敵對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Frost她啊，從小就只對音樂和食物這兩樣東西感興趣。就連休息對她來說都是浪費時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "這位朋友你可以等到我們真正會面了再介紹給我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對不起，我的老毛病又犯了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我信任醫生你，以及你掌握著的真相。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "我不認為你對真相的瞭解比我少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，只是我們有各自擅長的事情而已，比如說，我覺得你唱歌也許不會那麼動聽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，嗯，只是舉個例子！沒有要冒犯你的意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但阿戈爾的平靜，就像你知道的那樣，只是個表面現象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "大多數人對大海一無所知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大地的孩子又怎麼會知道這些呢？對他們要求太高也不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是，哪怕是這表面上的平靜，可能也無法堅持太久了。欲望果然是可怕的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以，我需要一些，嗯，訊息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "又是訊息？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這麼說......哦哦，原來對這些感興趣的不止我一個啊，哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我有些好奇，上一個人是誰呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "是個阿戈爾人，也是個深海獵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我們也許真的能做朋友呢，呼呼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "當然。我能理解你為什麼來找我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "活得越久，故事越多，傷痕越疼，脾氣越差。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉，我不是想揭你的傷疤......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是你確實不像其他人。他們會被過多的感情束縛、被言論利用，甚至變成某種災難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也難怪那個人讓你作為最後的底牌來幫助小兔子和Dr.{@nickname}。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你其實是台X光機對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "我也希望自己是台單純的機器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔，不好意思，我其實只是想說，雖然你不會選擇告知別人，但裡面的東西，你其實已經全看到了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "這個問題，我不能回答你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就讓我切入主題吧。這個問題你是可以回答的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "說吧，年輕的巨星。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "請告訴我，你所知道的，關於那片海洋下發生的一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "這不是一種訊息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，我說的是，“那片海洋”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Frost是我們中最年輕的。只有我們四個是年輕的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她嗅到那幾個阿戈爾人的味道。那不是阿戈爾人應該有的味道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“它們不能再歌唱。它們不能再說話。它們離我們越來越遠。它們饑渴難耐。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "AMa-10凱爾希醫生，請你告訴我——這些特別的阿戈爾人，他們是怎麼誕生的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
